  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gui Wang names his era beside Spectral Soul Demon Venerable when arguing that Lang Ya blessed land has already burned through Long Hair Ancestor’s white litchi immortal essence across those eras.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gui_wang",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a shiny bald head and wears plain clothing. He has a kind expression and his entire body lets out a faint radiance.",
      "chapters": [
        2196
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Gu world, rank nine is Venerable. Immortal Venerable names a rank nine righteous Gu Master; Demon Venerable names a rank nine demonic path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Yi Yan’s Prophecy of Three Venerables names Spectral Soul Demon Venerable first, Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable second, and Great Dream Immortal Venerable third. After Spectral Soul dies, a rank nine male Gu Immortal appears on the righteous path and is known as Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable; by the Lang Ya stretch he is already dead.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prophecy-and-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_great_dream_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Northern Plains history stretch lists ten rank nine Gu Masters across antiquity and calls him the peaceful Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable beside bloodthirsty Spectral Soul, mysterious Red Lotus, and knowledgeable Star Constellation.",
      "chapters": [
        552
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peaceful-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same era is used as a lower bound when dating Di Qiu inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        556
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peaceful-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within wisdom path, heavenly secret Gu lets a Gu Immortal take answers from a strand of heavenly secret without ordinary thought collision. Historical record credits Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable with creating that Gu; he held a rank eight heavenly secret Immortal Gu that vanished without news after his death. Rumor also calls him the rank nine Gu Master who could detect and react to heavenly fate most closely, and says he created the Gu to interact with heaven and earth and to experience natural inspiration again.",
      "chapters": [
        657
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "credited-with-gu-creation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Yu Lu is named his second disciple when Fang Yuan explains Yu Lu blessed land to Shark Demon.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_yu_lu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "char_shark_demon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later Eastern Sea talk repeats that she was his second disciple, a rank eight great expert, and that he was most skilled in battlefield killer moves, with Yu Lu learning that core and innovating her own versions.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reincarnation battlefield is the publicly recognized number one battlefield killer move in the world and was set up by him; Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects contest that site for years.",
      "chapters": [
        745
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later Eastern Sea remark again credits him with leaving the number one battlefield killer move inheritance in human history.",
      "chapters": [
        888
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fighting soul battlefield is a battlefield killer move he created after using one of Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s inheritances as a reference. His other creations leave a way to survive, but this one carries Spectral Soul’s killing nature and is called the most deadly among his battlefield killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        898
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unmoving troops is another battlefield immortal killer move he created personally; before rank nine he used it to subdue the rank seven sound path Gu Immortal Gao Ming without moving, and Gao Ming then became his guard. That stretch also calls his temperament mild and kind, different from the other nine Gu Immortal Venerables.",
      "chapters": [
        917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-killer-move-legacy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gao_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tang Miao judges that only the Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable inheritance she and her brother hold can move the lone cultivator White Sea Shatuo to help.",
      "chapters": [
        775
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-that-can-move-white-sea-shatuo",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_white_sea_shatuo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Spectral Soul dies and Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable appears, he is remembered as kind and merciful, loving peace, and suppressing soul path so that soul-path numbers fall and soul trade is forced underground while the five regions recuperate. People remember that he won support with virtue rather than force.",
      "chapters": [
        996
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reputation-and-true-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin confirms he is the inheritor of Paradise Earth’s true inheritance. That inheritance has no offensive methods and specializes in trapping and reforming enemies. Among the ten Venerables he is the kindest and most merciful, the one who healed the world after Spectral Soul’s rule, and for some reason he did not choose to go to Heavenly Court, staying in Southern Border and leaving the true inheritance there.",
      "chapters": [
        1548
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reputation-and-true-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In his later years he searched for lifespan Gu, but demand far exceeded the supply and lifespan Gu became rarer until they vanished. After he died, a new cycle began as the world recuperated and lifespan Gu appeared again.",
      "chapters": [
        1074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lifespan-gu-shortage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_lifespan_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable spends great effort locating the hiding place of legendary immemorial desolate beasts Zuo Ye Hui and You Tian Guang; in the ensuing battle You Tian Guang dies while Zuo Ye Hui escapes heavily injured.",
      "chapters": [
        1337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hunting-the-immemorial-beasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zuo_ye_hui",
        "char_you_tian_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s formation path true inheritance is among the collection that passes to Fang Yuan when he completely inherits Shadow Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-path-inheritance-passes-to-fang-yuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the Medieval Antiquity Era comes the Late Antiquity Era, one hundred thousand years before the present. Spectral Soul and Paradise Earth appear in that era.",
      "chapters": [
        1867
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-antiquity-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A late roster of the ten great Venerables places Spectral Soul Demon Venerable and Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable under Late Antiquity Era, a hundred thousand years ago.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-antiquity-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
